                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.105/466: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Haiti</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Drew</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-09-29T13:00:00-05:00">September 29, 1933—1
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>71. Your despatch No. 131, September 20, 1933. You are authorized to sign the
                    amendment to the Garde Agreement as submitted in the above-mentioned
                    despatch.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
